        ],
        "roles": [],
        "style": null,
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "admonition",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Not all items in the list have to be checklist items, as "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Example 1"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "#ex-syntax"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " shows."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null,
        "type": "tip"
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "When checklists are converted to HTML, the checkbox markup is transformed into an HTML checkbox with the appropriate checked state. The "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "data-item-complete"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " attribute on the checkbox is set to 1 if the item is checked, 0 if not. The checkbox is used in place of the item’s bullet."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Since HTML generated from AsciiDoc is typically static, the checkbox is set as disabled to make it appear as a simple mark. If you want to make the checkbox interactive (i.e., clickable), add the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "interactive"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " option to the checklist (shown here using the shorthand syntax for the "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "attributes:options.html"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "attributes:options.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "):"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "listing",
        "id": "ex-interactive",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "[%interactive]\n* [*] checked\n* [x] also checked\n* [ ] not checked\n* normal list item"
          }
        ],
        "language": "asciidoc",
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Checklist with interactive checkboxes"
          }
        ]
